        explanation: "OPTIMIZE compacts many small Parquet files into fewer larger ones (bin-compaction), reducing file overhead and speeding reads/MERGE.",
        whyWrong: "VACUUM removes old files; BROADCAST/CACHE are query hints, not file compaction.",
